epos/godotengine/godot/issues/101504","id":2814070890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nu1Bq","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-17T21:37:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T21:37:01Z","body":"> I rebased PR #89409 on top of this PR, but instead of just moving the navigation servers into the navigation folder, I split the navigation folder into navigation_2d and navigation_3d. Now that the 2D and 3D navigation servers are independent, we can separate them into folders and allow compiling without them.\r\n\r\nWas testing it and I have found that `NavigationMesh` is used by 2D navigation and it requires `NavigationServer3D`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814070890/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815117142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101504#issuecomment-2815117142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101504","id":2815117142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ny0dW","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T10:00:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:01:38Z","body":"It is used strictly for debugging, which can be enabled in non-3D exports, please open a bug report for the issues this might cause\r\n\r\n`NavigationPolygon` doesn't use any 3D features as far as I can see, you can just generate a mesh from a polygon, and that shouldn't depend on any 3D features unless used with 3D features","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815117142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816077785","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101504#issuecomment-2816077785","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101504","id":2816077785,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n2e_Z","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T19:32:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T19:32:09Z","body":"> It is used strictly for debugging, which can be enabled in non-3D exports, please open a bug report for the issues this might cause\r\n\r\nI have allowed the editor to be built with 3D disabled, and the build failed because `NavigationMesh` includes `NavigationServer3D` for visual debugging so i will try to see if there's a workaround for that since `BaseMaterial3D` is not initialized when 3D is disabled.\r\n\r\nAlso I have spotted this in `scene_debugger.cpp` that may cause issues in the future, I know it's unrelated to this PR but i just wanted to let you know about it.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n#ifndef PHYSICS_2D_DISABLED\r\n\t\t\tCollisionShape3D *collision_shape = Object::cast_to<CollisionShape3D>(node_3d);\r\n\t\t\tif (collision_shape) {\r\n\t\t\t\tRef<Shape3D> shape = collision_shape->get_shape();\r\n\t\t\t\tif (shape.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tbounds = shape->get_debug_mesh()->get_aabb();\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n#endif // PHYSICS_2D_DISABLED\r\n```\r\n\r\nI really appreciate The work you are doing since i have been waiting so long for this, thanks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816077785/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816677033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101504#issuecomment-2816677033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101504","id":2816677033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4xSp","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T12:04:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T12:04:14Z","body":"That doesn't sound like it comes from this PR but from:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104811\r\n\r\nBut enabling building the editor without 3D should include fixing such things, so it's not really related to this PR if it fails with custom code, but if things fail while building the engine itself (not a modified version) please open an issue for it, but custom changes causing issues isn't really something that's related to my work ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816677033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]